1213-3. prefer local edits over broad rewrite
1214-4. explain why the change is needed
1215-5. keep the blast radius explicit
1216-6. verify before claiming a fix
1217-7. separate checked behavior from unverified behavior
1218-8. summarize the safest next validation step if full validation is not possible
1219-
1220-Do not:
1221-- rewrite broadly without justification
