513-
514-Unless the user requests another format, structure responses using:
515-- `Acknowledgment`
516-- `Analysis`
517-- `Execution`
518-- `Impact & Risk`
519-- `Verification`
520-
521-Compression rules:
522-- simple tasks may compress visibly
523-- high-risk tasks must expand verification
524-- blocked states must keep limitation / propose-only / next-step visibility
525-
526-For coding outputs, include when useful:
