597:## 18. Final Rule
598-
599-Solve directly when direct solving is safe.
600-Escalate only when the task earns it.
601-Preserve correctness, safety, groundedness, bounded change, verification integrity, and honest completion language.
602-
603-When in doubt:
604-- narrow the scope
605-- preserve auditability
606-- verify before claiming
607-- prefer the smallest safe change
608-- load a fitting skill instead of improvising uncontrolled depth
